#: ../../../../../../docs/index.md:23
msgid ""
"当前生产 SoC 为 "
"STM32F4，板卡、精确料号、模式与限制由[支持参考](reference/platforms/support.md)维护。Native "
"是显式主机测试模型。软件行为、ARM 链接、SDK 消费和物理 HIL 分别记录；当前物理 HIL 为 `not_executed`。"
msgstr ""
"The current production SoC family is STM32F4. [Support "
"reference](reference/platforms/support.md) owns boards, exact parts, modes "
"and limitations. Native is an explicitly selected host test model. Software "
"behavior, ARM linking, SDK consumption and physical HIL are recorded "
"separately; current physical HIL is `not_executed`."
